         <div type="bio">
            <p>Well-to-do maternal uncle of <name type="person" key="barn84">Nora Barnacle</name>, a career employee of the Customs Office in Galway. JJ was fond of him (in part thanks to Healy’s occasional financial support) and the two corresponded steadily until Healy’s death. <hi rend="bold">William Brockman</hi>
                </p>
